**Independent Claim 1**
A drone battery swapping station, comprising:
    a. a robotic gripper configured to grasp and remove a spent battery from a drone;
    b. a rotating carousel, said carousel comprising a plurality of battery receptacles, each receptacle configured to receive a battery;
    c. a thermal management subsystem configured to regulate the temperature of the batteries and the carousel; and
    d. a control system, said control system being in communication with the robotic gripper, the carousel, and the thermal management subsystem, wherein said control system is configured to:
        i. control the robotic gripper to grasp and remove the spent battery from the drone;
        ii. rotate the carousel to position a new battery in the receptacle adjacent to the drone;
        iii. control the thermal management subsystem to regulate the temperature of the new battery; and
        iv. signal the drone to accept the new battery.

